{
  "openapi": "3.0.3",
  "info": {
    "title": "API IDEE - Timeline",
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
  "servers": [
    { "url": "http://localhost:8080/api-idee",                      "description": "Local"      },
    { "url": "https://componentes-desarrollo.idee.es/api-idee",    "description": "Desarrollo" },
    { "url": "https://componentes.idee.es/api-idee",               "description": "Producción" }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "Timeline",
      "description": "Configuración del control Timeline para la visualización temporal de capas cartográficas"
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/api/js": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["Timeline"],
        "summary": "Configura el control Timeline (GET)",
        "description": "Genera el código JavaScript que inicializa un mapa IDEE con el control **Timeline**.\nLos parámetros del control se pasan con el prefijo `controls.timeline.` seguido del nombre del campo.\n\n**Ejemplo de llamada:**\n```\nGET /api/js?controls.timeline.timelineType=absoluteSimple&controls.timeline.animation=true\n```\n**Respuesta:**\n```javascript\nIDEE.map({\"container\":\"map\"}).addControls(new IDEE.control.Timeline({\"timelineType\":\"absoluteSimple\",\"animation\":true}))\n```\n",
        "operationId": "timelineGet",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "controls.timeline.timelineType",
            "in": "query",
            "required": true,
            "description": "**Obligatorio.** Tipo de línea temporal:\n- `absoluteSimple` — capas estáticas intercambiables (sin fechas).\n- `absolute` — capas con rangos de fecha absolutos.\n- `relative` — capas con rangos de fecha relativos.\n",
            "schema": { "type": "string", "enum": ["absoluteSimple", "absolute", "relative"] },
            "example": "absoluteSimple"
          },
          {
            "name": "controls.timeline.position",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Posición horizontal del panel.",
            "schema": { "type": "string", "enum": ["left", "right" , "center-top-left", "center-top-right", "center-bottom-left", "center-bottom-right", "down"], "default": "left" },
            "example": "left"
          },
          {
            "name": "controls.timeline.animation",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Activa la reproducción animada automática.",
            "schema": { "type": "boolean", "default": true },
            "example": true
          },
          {
            "name": "controls.timeline.speed",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Velocidad de reproducción (1–100).",
            "schema": { "type": "number", "minimum": 1, "maximum": 100, "default": 1 },
            "example": 1
          },
          {
            "name": "controls.timeline.tooltip",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Texto del tooltip del botón del panel.",
            "schema": { "type": "string" },
            "example": "Línea temporal"
          },
          {
            "name": "controls.timeline.speedDate",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Velocidad de avance de fecha en modos `absolute` y `relative`.",
            "schema": { "type": "number", "default": 2 },
            "example": 2
          },
          {
            "name": "controls.timeline.paramsDate",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Unidad de avance de fecha (`yr` = año, `mo` = mes, `dy` = día).",
            "schema": { "type": "string", "enum": ["yr", "mo", "dy"], "default": "yr" },
            "example": "yr"
          },
          {
            "name": "controls.timeline.stepValue",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Número de unidades que avanza cada paso.",
            "schema": { "type": "number", "default": 1 },
            "example": 1
          },
          {
            "name": "controls.timeline.sizeWidthDinamic",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Ancho personalizado del componente en modo dinámico (CSS, e.g. `400px`).",
            "schema": { "type": "string", "default": "" },
            "example": "400px"
          },
          {
            "name": "controls.timeline.formatMove",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Modo de desplazamiento del slider.",
            "schema": { "type": "string", "enum": ["continuous", "discrete"], "default": "continuous" },
            "example": "continuous"
          },
          {
            "name": "controls.timeline.formatValue",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Formato de visualización del valor del slider.",
            "schema": { "type": "string", "default": "linear" },
            "example": "linear"
          },
          {
            "name": "controls.timeline.intervals",
            "in": "query",
            "required": true,
            "description": "**Obligatorio.** Array de intervalos serializado como JSON.\n\nDebido a que los corchetes `[` `]` son caracteres reservados en URLs, el constructor los espera codificados como `!!` (abre) y `¡¡` (cierra).\n\n**Formato `absoluteSimple`** — cada objeto tiene `name`, `tag` y `service`:\n```\n!![{\"name\":\"PNOA 2020\",\"tag\":\"pnoa2020\",\"service\":\"WMTS*url*...\"}]¡¡\n```\n\n**Formato `absolute` / `relative`** — cada objeto añade `init` y `end`:\n```\n!![{\"name\":\"Ortofotos\",\"tag\":\"orto\",\"service\":\"WMS*url*...\",\"init\":\"2000\",\"end\":\"2023\"}]¡¡\n```\n",
            "schema": { "type": "string" },
            "examples": {
              "absoluteSimple": {
                "summary": "absoluteSimple — 3 capas PNOA",
                "value": "!![{\"name\":\"PNOA 2020\",\"tag\":\"pnoa2020\",\"service\":\"WMTS*https://www.ign.es/wmts/pnoa-ma?*OI.OrthoimageCoverage*GoogleMapsCompatible*PNOA MA*true*image/jpeg\"},{\"name\":\"PNOA 2019\",\"tag\":\"pnoa2019\",\"service\":\"WMTS*https://www.ign.es/wmts/pnoa-ma?*OI.OrthoimageCoverage*GoogleMapsCompatible*PNOA 2019*true*image/jpeg\"},{\"name\":\"PNOA 2018\",\"tag\":\"pnoa2018\",\"service\":\"WMTS*https://www.ign.es/wmts/pnoa-historico?*PNOA2018*GoogleMapsCompatible*PNOA 2018*true*image/jpeg\"}]¡¡"
              },
              "absolute": {
                "summary": "absolute — rango de fechas",
                "value": "!![{\"name\":\"Ortofotos históricas\",\"tag\":\"orto_historica\",\"service\":\"WMS*https://pnoa.ign.es/web/wcs/pnoa/ows?*Mosaic*false*Mosaico PNOA*true\",\"init\":\"2000\",\"end\":\"2023\"}]¡¡"
              },
              "relative": {
                "summary": "relative — serie histórica por meses",
                "value": "!![{\"name\":\"Serie histórica\",\"tag\":\"serie\",\"service\":\"WMS*https://servicios.idee.es/wms-inspire/ocupacion-suelo-historico?*LC.LandCoverSurfaces*true*Usos del suelo*true\",\"init\":\"1990\",\"end\":\"2018\"}]¡¡"
              }
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Código JavaScript que inicializa el mapa con el control Timeline.",
            "content": {
              "text/plain": {
                "examples": {
                  "absoluteSimple": {
                    "summary": "absoluteSimple — 3 capas PNOA",
                    "value": "IDEE.map({\"container\":\"map\"}).addControls(new IDEE.control.Timeline({\"timelineType\":\"absoluteSimple\",\"animation\":true,\"intervals\":[{\"name\":\"PNOA 2020\",\"tag\":\"pnoa2020\",\"service\":\"WMTS*https://www.ign.es/wmts/pnoa-ma?*OI.OrthoimageCoverage*GoogleMapsCompatible*PNOA MA*true*image/jpeg\"},{\"name\":\"PNOA 2019\",\"tag\":\"pnoa2019\",\"service\":\"WMTS*https://www.ign.es/wmts/pnoa-ma?*OI.OrthoimageCoverage*GoogleMapsCompatible*PNOA 2019*true*image/jpeg\"},{\"name\":\"PNOA 2018\",\"tag\":\"pnoa2018\",\"service\":\"WMTS*https://www.ign.es/wmts/pnoa-historico?*PNOA2018*GoogleMapsCompatible*PNOA 2018*true*image/jpeg\"}]}))\n"
                  },
                  "absoluteConFecha": {
                    "summary": "absolute — rango de fechas dinámico",
                    "value": "IDEE.map({\"container\":\"map\"}).addControls(new IDEE.control.Timeline({\"timelineType\":\"absolute\",\"paramsDate\":\"yr\",\"speedDate\":2,\"intervals\":[{\"name\":\"Ortofotos históricas\",\"tag\":\"orto_historica\",\"service\":\"WMS*https://pnoa.ign.es/web/wcs/pnoa/ows?*Mosaic*false*Mosaico PNOA*true\",\"init\":\"2000\",\"end\":\"2023\"}]}))\n"
                  },
                  "relativoDiscrete": {
                    "summary": "relative — slider discreto",
                    "value": "IDEE.map({\"container\":\"map\"}).addControls(new IDEE.control.Timeline({\"timelineType\":\"relative\",\"formatMove\":\"discrete\",\"stepValue\":3,\"intervals\":[{\"name\":\"Serie histórica\",\"tag\":\"serie\",\"service\":\"WMS*https://servicios.idee.es/wms-inspire/ocupacion-suelo-historico?*LC.LandCoverSurfaces*true*Usos del suelo*true\",\"init\":\"1990\",\"end\":\"2018\"}]}))\n"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "post": {
        "tags": ["Timeline"],
        "summary": "Configura el control Timeline (POST JSON)",
        "description": "Genera el código JavaScript que inicializa un mapa IDEE con el control **Timeline**.\nEl cuerpo de la petición es un objeto JSON con la clave `controls`.\n",
        "operationId": "timelinePost",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TimelinePostRequest" },
              "examples": {
                "absoluteSimple": {
                  "summary": "Capas PNOA intercambiables (absoluteSimple)",
                  "value": {
                    "controls": [
                      {
                        "type": "Timeline",
                        "params": {
                          "position": "left",
                          "timelineType": "absoluteSimple",
                          "animation": true,
                          "speed": 1,
                          "intervals": [
                            { "name": "PNOA 2020", "tag": "pnoa2020", "service": "WMTS*https://www.ign.es/wmts/pnoa-ma?*OI.OrthoimageCoverage*GoogleMapsCompatible*PNOA MA*true*image/jpeg"   },
                            { "name": "PNOA 2019", "tag": "pnoa2019", "service": "WMTS*https://www.ign.es/wmts/pnoa-ma?*OI.OrthoimageCoverage*GoogleMapsCompatible*PNOA 2019*true*image/jpeg" },
                            { "name": "PNOA 2018", "tag": "pnoa2018", "service": "WMTS*https://www.ign.es/wmts/pnoa-historico?*PNOA2018*GoogleMapsCompatible*PNOA 2018*true*image/jpeg"       }
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "absolute": {
                  "summary": "Rango de fechas dinámico (absolute)",
                  "value": {
                    "controls": [
                      {
                        "type": "Timeline",
                        "params": {
                          "position": "left",
                          "timelineType": "absolute",
                          "animation": true,
                          "speed": 1,
                          "speedDate": 2,
                          "paramsDate": "yr",
                          "stepValue": 1,
                          "formatMove": "continuous",
                          "formatValue": "linear",
                          "intervals": [
                            { "name": "Ortofotos históricas", "tag": "orto_historica", "service": "WMS*https://pnoa.ign.es/web/wcs/pnoa/ows?*Mosaic*false*Mosaico PNOA*true", "init": "2000", "end": "2023" }
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "relative": {
                  "summary": "Slider discreto con ancho personalizado (relative)",
                  "value": {
                    "controls": [
                      {
                        "type": "Timeline",
                        "params": {
                          "position": "right",
                          "timelineType": "relative",
                          "animation": false,
                          "speed": 1,
                          "speedDate": 1,
                          "paramsDate": "mo",
                          "stepValue": 3,
                          "sizeWidthDinamic": "500px",
                          "formatMove": "discrete",
                          "tooltip": "Línea temporal",
                          "intervals": [
                            { "name": "Serie histórica", "tag": "serie", "service": "WMS*https://servicios.idee.es/wms-inspire/ocupacion-suelo-historico?*LC.LandCoverSurfaces*true*Usos del suelo*true", "init": "1990", "end": "2018" }
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Código JavaScript que inicializa el mapa con el control Timeline.",
            "content": {
              "text/plain": {
                "examples": {
                  "respuestaAbsoluteSimple": {
                    "summary": "JS con Timeline absoluteSimple (3 capas PNOA)",
                    "value": "IDEE.map({\"container\":\"map\"}).addControls(new IDEE.control.Timeline({\"position\":\"left\",\"timelineType\":\"absoluteSimple\",\"animation\":true,\"speed\":1,\"intervals\":[{\"name\":\"PNOA 2020\",\"tag\":\"pnoa2020\",\"service\":\"WMTS*https://www.ign.es/wmts/pnoa-ma?*OI.OrthoimageCoverage*GoogleMapsCompatible*PNOA MA*true*image/jpeg\"},{\"name\":\"PNOA 2019\",\"tag\":\"pnoa2019\",\"service\":\"WMTS*https://www.ign.es/wmts/pnoa-ma?*OI.OrthoimageCoverage*GoogleMapsCompatible*PNOA 2019*true*image/jpeg\"},{\"name\":\"PNOA 2018\",\"tag\":\"pnoa2018\",\"service\":\"WMTS*https://www.ign.es/wmts/pnoa-historico?*PNOA2018*GoogleMapsCompatible*PNOA 2018*true*image/jpeg\"}]}))\n"
                  },
                  "respuestaAbsolute": {
                    "summary": "JS con Timeline absolute con rango de fechas",
                    "value": "IDEE.map({\"container\":\"map\"}).addControls(new IDEE.control.Timeline({\"position\":\"left\",\"timelineType\":\"absolute\",\"animation\":true,\"speed\":1,\"speedDate\":2,\"paramsDate\":\"yr\",\"stepValue\":1,\"formatMove\":\"continuous\",\"formatValue\":\"linear\",\"intervals\":[{\"name\":\"Ortofotos históricas\",\"tag\":\"orto_historica\",\"service\":\"WMS*https://pnoa.ign.es/web/wcs/pnoa/ows?*Mosaic*false*Mosaico PNOA*true\",\"init\":\"2000\",\"end\":\"2023\"}]}))\n"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "JSON inválido o parámetros incorrectos.",
            "content": {
              "text/plain": { "example": "// Error processing JSON: Unexpected token ..." }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "schemas": {
      "TimelinePostRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["controls"],
        "description": "Cuerpo de la petición POST. El servidor procesa el array `controls` llamando a `createControlFromJSON` por cada elemento (`type` → nombre del constructor, `params` → opciones).",
        "properties": {
          "controls": {
            "type": "array",
            "minItems": 1,
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": ["type", "params"],
              "properties": {
                "type": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "Nombre del control tal como aparece en `IDEE.control.{type}`.",
                  "example": "Timeline"
                },
                "params": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TimelineOptions" }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "TimelineOptions": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["timelineType", "intervals"],
        "description": "Opciones de configuración del control Timeline.",
        "properties": {
          "position": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Posición del panel (horizontal).",
            "enum": ["left", "right"],
            "default": "left",
            "example": "left"
          },
          "timelineType": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "**Obligatorio.** Tipo de línea temporal:\n- `absoluteSimple` — capas estáticas intercambiables (sin fechas).\n- `absolute` — capas con rangos de fecha absolutos (año/mes/día).\n- `relative` — capas con rangos de fecha relativos.\n",
            "enum": ["absoluteSimple", "absolute", "relative"],
            "example": "absoluteSimple"
          },
          "intervals": {
            "description": "Lista de intervalos/capas a mostrar en la línea temporal.\n\n- **`absoluteSimple`**: objetos con `name`, `tag` y `service`.\n- **`absolute` / `relative`**: objetos con `name`, `tag`, `service`, `init` y `end`.\n",
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "type": "array",
                "description": "Intervalos para `absoluteSimple`",
                "items": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TimelineIntervalSimple" }
              },
              {
                "type": "array",
                "description": "Intervalos para `absolute` / `relative` (con rango de fechas)",
                "items": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TimelineIntervalDate" }
              }
            ]
          },
          "animation":        { "type": "boolean", "description": "Activa la reproducción animada automática.",                         "default": true,         "example": true          },
          "speed":            { "type": "number",  "description": "Velocidad de reproducción (1–100).", "minimum": 1, "maximum": 100,   "default": 1,            "example": 1             },
          "tooltip":          { "type": "string",  "description": "Texto del tooltip del botón del panel.",                             "example": "Línea temporal" },
          "speedDate":        { "type": "number",  "description": "Velocidad del avance de fecha en modo dinámico (`absolute`/`relative`).", "default": 2,        "example": 2             },
          "paramsDate":       { "type": "string",  "description": "Unidad de avance de fecha: `yr` (año), `mo` (mes), `dy` (día).", "enum": ["yr","mo","dy"], "default": "yr", "example": "yr" },
          "stepValue":        { "type": "number",  "description": "Número de unidades que avanza cada paso en modo dinámico.",          "default": 1,            "example": 1             },
          "sizeWidthDinamic": { "type": "string",  "description": "Ancho personalizado del componente en modo dinámico (CSS, e.g. `\"400px\"`).", "default": "", "example": "400px"      },
          "formatMove":       { "type": "string",  "description": "Modo de desplazamiento del slider.", "enum": ["continuous","discrete"], "default": "continuous", "example": "continuous" },
          "formatValue":      { "type": "string",  "description": "Formato de visualización del valor del slider.",                    "default": "linear",     "example": "linear"      }
        }
      },
      "TimelineIntervalSimple": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "Intervalo para el tipo `absoluteSimple`.",
        "required": ["name", "service"],
        "properties": {
          "name":    { "type": "string", "description": "Nombre visible del intervalo en el slider.", "example": "PNOA 2020"    },
          "tag":     { "type": "string", "description": "Identificador interno del intervalo.",       "example": "pnoa2020"     },
          "service": { "type": "string", "description": "Capa en formato legado API-REST: `TIPO*url*nombre*...*parámetros`.", "example": "WMTS*https://www.ign.es/wmts/pnoa-ma?*OI.OrthoimageCoverage*GoogleMapsCompatible*PNOA MA*true*image/jpeg" }
        }
      },
      "TimelineIntervalDate": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "Intervalo para los tipos `absolute` y `relative`. Incluye rango de fechas.",
        "required": ["name", "service", "init", "end"],
        "properties": {
          "name":    { "type": "string", "description": "Nombre visible del intervalo.",              "example": "Ortofoto histórica" },
          "tag":     { "type": "string", "description": "Identificador interno del intervalo.",       "example": "orto_historica"     },
          "service": { "type": "string", "description": "Capa en formato legado API-REST.",           "example": "WMS*https://pnoa.ign.es/web/wcs/pnoa/ows?*Mosaic*false*Mosaico PNOA*true" },
          "init":    { "type": "string", "description": "Fecha de inicio del intervalo (ISO 8601).", "example": "2000"               },
          "end":     { "type": "string", "description": "Fecha de fin del intervalo (ISO 8601).",    "example": "2023"               }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
